    "Id": "chassisdef_falconer_FLC-12X",
    "Name": "Falconer",
    "Details": "A custom redesign of the Falconer for the Rabid Foxes - the special forces division of the Federated Suns, the FLC-12X switches to use a clan acquired Gauss Rifle and a Large Re-engineered Lasers instead of the Heavy PPC. It also mounts a Chameleon Light Polarization Shield.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.11</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
